{"full":"hf:iav2002/AI_Image_detector","spaceId":"iav2002/AI_Image_detector","name":"AI Image Detector","source":"huggingface","description":"Detects AI-generated images using ResNet50.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","topics":["streamlit","region:us"],"technologies":["Python"],"likes":3,"created":"2025-11-18T09:44:54.000Z","updated":"2026-02-27T12:57:51.000Z","license":"apache-2.0","runtime":"SLEEPING","appUrl":"https://iav2002-ai-image-detector.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/iav2002/AI_Image_detector","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T15:01:54.436Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T15:01:54.436Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T15:01:54.436Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"🎥","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The rapid advancement of Generative AI has democratized creativity, but it has also introduced significant risks. As synthetic media becomes indistinguishable from reality, the potential for misinformation, identity theft, and digital fraud increases. We developed this project to address the \"Verification Gap\"—the technological lag between the ability to create fake images and the ability to detect them.","While human eyes often look for obvious flaws (like extra fingers), AI models like ResNet50 analyze pixel-level distributions and compression artifacts that are invisible to humans. By using Transfer Learning, we adapted this powerful architecture to distinguish the subtle \"digital fingerprint\" left by Generative Adversarial Networks (GANs) and Diffusion models."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/iav2002/AI_Image_detector/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"824976709c98be1d8a90b6ae70c3accf9a614c9f0167882c8dcf7de408b0cabc","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T15:01:54.538Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T15:01:54.538Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"The rapid advancement of Generative AI has democratized creativity, but it has al